              "content": "Write one engaging Facebook and Instagram caption promoting Elite Automators’ AI voice receptionist for businesses across all industries.\n\nChoose one benefit for each post, such as answering calls 24/7, capturing more leads, scheduling appointments, reducing interruptions, improving response times, handling frequently asked questions, or delivering a consistent customer experience.\n\nOpen with a strong, natural hook. Explain the benefit in plain business language and finish with one clear call to action. Keep the main caption between 60 and 100 words. Do not focus on a specific industry unless it is used as a brief example. Avoid exaggerated promises, technical jargon, quotation marks, and repetitive phrasing.\n\nAfter the caption, add 5–8 relevant hashtags. Use a balanced mix of broad business, AI automation, customer-service, lead-generation, and branded hashtags. Change the selection between posts and avoid unrelated, spammy, or excessively broad hashtags. Always include #EliteAutomators.\n\nReturn only the finished caption and hashtags.\n"
            }
          ]
        },
